# Rust build output
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
*.tmp
# Cargo.lock is committed: the exact dependency graph is part of the reproducible build,
# and the dependency-count measurements in docs/M0-ground-truth.md are only meaningful
# against a recoverable graph.

# cargo-fuzz build output. `fuzz/` will be its own workspace (the root manifest already
# excludes it) with its own .gitignore; these root-anchored entries keep `reuse lint`
# (which reads this file) in agreement with git about what is generated. Curated
# `fuzz/corpus/` seeds are committed.
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/

# mise local overrides (per-developer, never committed)
/mise.local.toml
/.mise.local.toml

# Editor / OS
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.claude/
